{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"kv-cache-reduction-techniques-mc","content_sha256":"sha256:5d0673400b166fda55c4fdcf5c5a1f0d83759cfec1f17c9f029290d8a99ff7bc","correct_option_ids":["a","b","c"],"created_at":1789955478.60572,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"GQA/MQA(减少 KV 头)、MLA(低秩潜在压缩)、KV 量化都直接减小每 token 的 KV 字节数;此外还有 SWA/驱逐等。温度是采样参数,与 KV 显存无关(D 错)。","id":"q-infer-mag2-kv-reduction-techniques-mc-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"用 GQA/MQA 减少 KV 头数,让多个 query 头共享同一组 K/V"},{"id":"b","text":"用 MLA 将 K/V 压缩成低维潜在表示后缓存"},{"id":"c","text":"对 KV 做低比特量化(如 FP8/INT8)"},{"id":"d","text":"把采样温度调低到 0"}],"prompt":"下列哪些技术可用于降低 LLM 推理时 KV 缓存的显存占用?(多选)","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"GQA","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"DeepSeek-V2 MLA","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04434"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"kv-cache","type":"multi_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
